1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:40,870 --> 00:01:42,210
What did you smell?

10
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:44,690
I smell Changgeng the Great is here.

11
00:01:44,710 --> 00:01:45,820
I must have him as my Mentor.

12
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:04,770
Found it.

13
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,540
I still don't know Changgeng's

14
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,010
true appearance,

15
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:11,060
but as long as he is here,

16
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,980
the Pregenesis Sword

17
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:16,100
must be here too.

18
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:21,010
Elder Kuai Si,

19
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:23,060
it's time to act.

20
00:02:58,150 --> 00:02:59,010
Mentor, what are you doing?

21
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:00,170
Always so jumpy.

22
00:03:00,190 --> 00:03:00,780
What's wrong?

23
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,220
Is that how you talk to your Mentor?

24
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,260
Show some respect.

25
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:07,060
Mind your tone with your disciple.

26
00:03:07,470 --> 00:03:08,220
Next time you speak to your Mentor,

27
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,290
watch it a little.

28
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,780
Stop fidgeting.

29
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,820
What's wrong?

30
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,010
There's a mosquito.

31
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,010
It wasn't this dark earlier.

32
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,610
You kidding me?

33
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,730
So dark in here.

34
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:56,380
Hi.

35
00:04:58,140 --> 00:05:01,100
[Episode 19]

36
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:01,780
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

37
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:28,020
What are you screaming for?

38
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:33,460
What's going on?

39
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,660
Possession?

40
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,020
Help! Run!

41
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,700
Hanzhi, go.

42
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,100
Mentor.

43
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:53,810
Pearl Elites, form up.

44
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:03,610
Run.

45
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:04,250
Run.

46
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,220
Xiong Da.

47
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,460
She's up there.

48
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,850
Lingli, run.

49
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,340
It hurts so much.

50
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:30,900
Stay back.

51
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:34,700
No, don't bite me.

52
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:35,370
No.

53
00:06:35,510 --> 00:06:36,020
Don't bite.

54
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,660
Ascendance disciples, fall back.

55
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,100
Can't bite through?

56
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,100
Beat it.

57
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:01,610
Why doesn't it hurt?

58
00:07:05,390 --> 00:07:06,540
You even bit my crotch.

59
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,580
So shameless.

60
00:07:10,270 --> 00:07:12,100
Brothers, they eat people.

61
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:23,940
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

62
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,250
It's really solid.

63
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:36,220
Impressive.

64
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,250
Who?

65
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,900
3,000 spirit stones.

66
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,140
You Seizing Sect evildoer.

67
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:51,250
Still trying to trick Ascendance Sect?

68
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:52,850
Get out!

69
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,170
Just you wait.

70
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:10,170
What?

71
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,050
What's happening out there?

72
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,250
Xuanya, get inside.

73
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,650
Brat, what's going on?

74
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,490
It's nothing.

75
00:08:42,630 --> 00:08:43,850
I heard the sounds of fighting.

76
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:44,820
Let me see.

77
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,460
It's the Demon Clan. A sneak attack.

78
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:47,650
A sneak attack?

79
00:08:48,390 --> 00:08:49,250
Don't worry, Yunxiao.

80
00:08:49,790 --> 00:08:51,370
Everything is going as planned.

81
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,220
Just...

82
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,100
It came sooner than I expected.

83
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:56,770
What about my fellow cultivators?

84
00:08:56,790 --> 00:08:57,890
Go away.

85
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,980
They are safe with Zhao Gongming.

86
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,010
Rest assured, Yunxiao.

87
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:06,250
Uncle, run.

88
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,370
What are you doing?

89
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:35,100
Senior is in there. I must save her.

90
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,250
Calm down.

91
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:38,370
You can't save her on your own.

92
00:09:39,270 --> 00:09:40,980
Remember what I told you about hearts?

93
00:09:41,150 --> 00:09:41,940
Hearts?

94
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,980
Even the strongest man is futile alone.

95
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:49,180
Only a leader can save everyone.

96
00:09:50,270 --> 00:09:51,180
What should I do?

97
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,420
Don't catch me. Run.

98
00:09:55,030 --> 00:09:56,700
Brothers, run.

99
00:09:57,550 --> 00:09:58,220
Run.

100
00:09:58,510 --> 00:09:59,420
The timing is perfect.

101
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:00,770
Second Prince,

102
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,060
you have absorbed the Spiritual Power

103
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,220
of half the Mini Realm Scroll.

104
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,060
Ready to test your strength?

105
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:19,730
Time to turn the tide and make a name.

106
00:10:19,750 --> 00:10:20,460
Your Highness,

107
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,530
show your power.

108
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,370
Bring them to heel.

109
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:23,980
Make them your first followers.

110
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,460
I am Ao Yi, destined to be a light

111
00:10:29,870 --> 00:10:31,460
that shines upon the entire East Sea.

112
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,340
Senior.

113
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:37,300
I will save you.

114
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,650
Transform into a dragon.

115
00:10:44,790 --> 00:10:45,890
Run. Keep up.

116
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:47,420
Run.

117
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,340
What is that?

118
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:51,700
A great Deity.

119
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:54,220
A Deity.

120
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:57,820
We are saved.

121
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,820
No dragon. Just a worm.

122
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,890
Run that way.

123
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:13,980
Don't go.

124
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:14,980
Give me a chance.

125
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:22,300
Dragon's Prophecy...

126
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,100
Still hasn't recovered.

127
00:11:25,390 --> 00:11:26,250
What do we do now?

128
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,370
Seems we need the old way.

129
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:31,650
The old way?

130
00:11:33,870 --> 00:11:34,580
Run.

131
00:11:34,750 --> 00:11:35,340
Keep up.

132
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:37,530
Hurry. Run faster.

133
00:11:58,270 --> 00:11:59,700
So impressive.

134
00:12:01,630 --> 00:12:04,180
You absorbed half the scroll's power.

135
00:12:04,270 --> 00:12:06,700
Even without transforming,
you are still strong.

136
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:11,010
My power

137
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,850
is back.

138
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,850
Isn't he...

139
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:15,980
The worm from earlier?

140
00:12:16,630 --> 00:12:17,890
No wonder he looks familiar.

141
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,580
Sea Deity Sect disciples.

142
00:12:21,270 --> 00:12:23,250
Forgot what Sea Deity taught you?

143
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:25,980
Taught us what?

144
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,010
On my command.

145
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:51,730
Fire.

146
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:18,980
Cultivators of Seizing Sect.

147
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:21,250
Why commit such bloodshed?

148
00:13:22,270 --> 00:13:23,060
Detached Master,

149
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:27,060
why do you think we came to your sect?

150
00:13:27,790 --> 00:13:29,060
With your current cultivation,

151
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:31,460
you must foresee Ascendance Sect's

152
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:33,060
tribulation in 500 years.

153
00:13:34,670 --> 00:13:37,610
How do you know that?

154
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:40,490
But when that tribulation arrives,

155
00:13:40,550 --> 00:13:42,250
and we face life or death,

156
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:45,220
I believe the Three Sects here

157
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,980
can put aside the past

158
00:13:47,270 --> 00:13:48,460
and stand as one.

159
00:13:48,790 --> 00:13:51,820
I want to use that tribulation

160
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:55,250
to begin Unity of the Three Sects.

161
00:13:56,030 --> 00:13:57,250
You were worried

162
00:13:57,870 --> 00:14:01,060
your sect couldn't survive alone,

163
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:04,060
so you kept us as a backup plan.

164
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:04,850
But you didn't know

165
00:14:04,870 --> 00:14:07,850
our Seizing Sect is your tribulation.

166
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,250
We came here today

167
00:14:09,270 --> 00:14:12,010
to bury Ascendance Sect

168
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,650
along with your dream of unity.

169
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:24,890
Grandlord.

170
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,010
Grandlord.

171
00:14:27,270 --> 00:14:29,580
Attack!

172
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:03,370
Jiu Jiu is here. Meet your Death!

173
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:06,420
♪Always a lamp to light the valley♪

174
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:08,740
♪Or flying up to the heavens alone♪

175
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:12,270
♪To demand justice for the world♪

176
00:15:12,270 --> 00:15:13,060
Backup?

177
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:14,980
Little Uncle.

178
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,010
Charge!

179
00:15:16,010 --> 00:15:19,950
♪Someone will answer for me♪

180
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:20,850
Senior.

181
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:21,890
Thank goodness you're okay.

182
00:15:21,910 --> 00:15:22,460
Where is Mentor?

183
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:24,060
He got blown away.

184
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:26,340
♪Taking our steps together♪

185
00:15:27,490 --> 00:15:33,550
♪Fearing no storm or karma♪

186
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:34,580
Grandlord.

187
00:15:36,410 --> 00:15:37,960
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

188
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:38,650
Grandlord.

189
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,420
What's wrong, Grandlord?

190
00:15:43,970 --> 00:15:45,760
♪Who plots and schemes♪

191
00:15:46,570 --> 00:15:48,520
♪And set formations in the world♪

192
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:52,600
♪I will go in and stir things up♪

193
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:54,010
Why isn't Senior back yet?

194
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,060
♪Amid the clamoring voices♪

195
00:15:57,030 --> 00:15:57,700
Senior.

196
00:15:58,150 --> 00:15:59,700
Senior. I'm so glad you're okay.

197
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:01,250
Saw the fight outside and still ran out?

198
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:02,650
Copy Scripture of Steadiness 500 times.

199
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,650
I will.

200
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:04,300
Jiu Jiu.

201
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:04,850
Grandlord.

202
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,820
Why are you here?

203
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:06,610
Over a dozen miles away,

204
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:08,980
a Demon Army is heading this way.

205
00:16:09,270 --> 00:16:11,250
Did Seizing Sect collude with them

206
00:16:11,270 --> 00:16:12,650
to conquer Ascendance Sect?

207
00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:14,060
Time to show them what we've got.

208
00:16:14,270 --> 00:16:15,610
Disciples, after them.

209
00:16:15,790 --> 00:16:17,060
Capture them all!

210
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:20,650
Here.

211
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,220
Where to?

212
00:16:23,550 --> 00:16:24,650
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

213
00:16:26,790 --> 00:16:27,890
Defending Formation.

214
00:16:28,510 --> 00:16:29,490
Open.

215
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:51,300
Elders of all divisions, hold it firmly.

216
00:16:57,830 --> 00:16:58,880
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

217
00:16:58,960 --> 00:16:59,740
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

218
00:16:59,740 --> 00:17:00,370
Grandlord.

219
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:01,270
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

220
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:01,820
Grandlord.

221
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:02,890
Grandlord.

222
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,180
What a pity.

223
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:15,050
We couldn't capture Zhao Gongming.

224
00:17:15,350 --> 00:17:18,090
If we could make him the leader,

225
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:21,250
the story of Seizing Sect's attack

226
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,700
would be much more interesting.

227
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,860
Defending Formation?

228
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,050
Smash it.

229
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,250
Go. Go.

230
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:49,290
Disciples below Verity Immortal,

231
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:51,050
shelter in the Hall of Mortal Coils.

232
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,180
Careful.

233
00:17:59,110 --> 00:17:59,900
Go, go, go.

234
00:18:00,030 --> 00:18:01,420
Senior, should we run?

235
00:18:02,070 --> 00:18:03,220
Have you reached Verity Immortal?

236
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:03,860
Not yet.

237
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,050
Then why are you just watching?

238
00:18:05,070 --> 00:18:05,660
Run.

239
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,250
Keep up. Be careful.

240
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:24,420
Now that

241
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:26,460
the Grandlord is heavily injured,

242
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:30,010
I am the only Aureate Immortal here.

243
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:33,620
Naturally, I should give the orders.

244
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,010
With the Grandlord absent,

245
00:18:37,310 --> 00:18:38,050
all orders

246
00:18:38,070 --> 00:18:40,050
must be decided by the elders.

247
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,900
This is our sect's tradition.

248
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:42,940
Kuai Si,

249
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,250
do you want to break the rule?

250
00:18:45,270 --> 00:18:47,900
There's no time to debate in crisis.

251
00:18:48,070 --> 00:18:49,420
Do as I say.

252
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:52,050
All elders, lead the disciples

253
00:18:52,070 --> 00:18:53,810
to retreat to Hall of Mortal Coils.

254
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,660
The Grandlord ordered before passing out

255
00:18:55,830 --> 00:18:57,620
that we must
hold the Defending Formation.

256
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:58,860
We should stay here

257
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:00,620
and feed it Spiritual Power.

258
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:03,330
Defend, and Spiritual Power runs dry.

259
00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:05,380
Once the formation falls,

260
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:06,460
and we have no power left,

261
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,810
wouldn't that be suicide?

262
00:19:07,830 --> 00:19:08,620
But the Grandlord said...

263
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:09,810
The Grandlord?

264
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:11,860
The Seizing Sect broke in

265
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:13,620
because the Grandlord messed up.

266
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:15,050
He let them into Ascendance Sect.

267
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:15,460
You...

268
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,250
That's true.

269
00:19:16,270 --> 00:19:18,660
Our sect has been in total chaos

270
00:19:19,270 --> 00:19:21,420
because the Grandlord allowed it.

271
00:19:22,070 --> 00:19:24,220
The Elucidating guests fled the crisis.

272
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:26,420
And the Seizing disciples had schemes.

273
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:27,860
There is absolutely no honor

274
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,900
among these Three Sects.

275
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:30,290
You all...

276
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,250
He's right.

277
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:34,050
Please, Elders,

278
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:37,140
retreat to Hall of Mortal Coils now.

279
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:38,250
Do not delay.

280
00:19:38,270 --> 00:19:38,730
Yes.

281
00:19:38,750 --> 00:19:39,460
Wait.

282
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:42,460
If Seizing Sect and Demon Army attack,

283
00:19:42,790 --> 00:19:44,420
what about the other divisions?

284
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:50,420
Then those divisions can only blame

285
00:19:52,270 --> 00:19:53,860
their ill fortune.

286
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:54,620
Move aside.

287
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:56,570
Make way. All of you.

288
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:57,620
Move.

289
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:58,460
Grandlord.

290
00:19:58,480 --> 00:19:59,140
Grandlord.

291
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:01,860
Grandlord.

292
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:03,140
Grandlord.

293
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:05,010
This is bad.

294
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:06,980
Where are you going?

295
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,010
I'm looking for Mentor.

296
00:20:08,030 --> 00:20:09,180
I don't know how he is.

297
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:10,620
You think I made no plans?

298
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:11,660
Wanna copy scriptures again?

299
00:20:14,070 --> 00:20:15,090
All this noise.

300
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:17,250
What's going on?

301
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,620
Changshou, let me out.

302
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:24,730
Grandlord.

303
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:27,220
I failed you.

304
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:29,380
If I had patrolled carefully

305
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,980
and reported earlier,

306
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,290
maybe this wouldn't have happened.

307
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:34,940
Senior.

308
00:20:35,590 --> 00:20:36,660
Take good care of Grandlord.

309
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:37,570
What are you doing?

310
00:20:38,550 --> 00:20:40,250
I'm going out to strike down all I can.

311
00:20:40,350 --> 00:20:41,530
I must avenge Grandlord.

312
00:20:41,550 --> 00:20:42,290
Have you lost your mind?

313
00:20:42,310 --> 00:20:43,180
I don't care.

314
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:46,250
Ever since I joined this sect,

315
00:20:47,070 --> 00:20:48,420
I've done nothing but drink,

316
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:49,700
mess up, and cause trouble.

317
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,380
What else am I good for?

318
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:54,010
Even if you die,

319
00:20:54,030 --> 00:20:55,460
would that make it right with Grandlord?

320
00:20:55,790 --> 00:20:57,290
Then let this be Grandlord's punishment.

321
00:20:58,160 --> 00:20:59,770
I'll pay with my life.

322
00:21:00,350 --> 00:21:01,490
Out of my way.

323
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:04,140
Grandlord punished you, not for death.

324
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:05,380
He wants you alive.

325
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:06,980
So you can protect everyone.

326
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:19,050
If you hadn't patrolled today,

327
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:21,980
who would have saved us?

328
00:21:28,960 --> 00:21:30,250
Every time Grandlord punished you,

329
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:32,900
others thought he was disappointed.

330
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:36,250
But he always favored you the most.

331
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:44,050
If Grandlord really hated you,

332
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:47,050
he'd have struck you.

333
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:51,050
But over all these years,

334
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:53,570
did he ever hurt you?

335
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:57,420
Jiu Jiu,

336
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:01,330
in the name of Senior,

337
00:22:02,510 --> 00:22:03,980
I punish you on Grandlord's behalf.

338
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:09,250
Jiu Jiu of Griefbane, hear my command.

339
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:13,980
You must stay here

340
00:22:15,070 --> 00:22:16,490
and protect the Hall of Mortal Coils

341
00:22:17,830 --> 00:22:19,660
and all the disciples.

342
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:21,090
Do not take a single step away.

343
00:22:22,070 --> 00:22:22,420
But I...

344
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,180
Obey the command.

345
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,620
I obey.

346
00:23:15,790 --> 00:23:16,380
Senior.

347
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:18,900
Stop crying.

348
00:23:20,750 --> 00:23:22,700
Mentor wasn't like this before.

349
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,860
Mentor

350
00:23:28,030 --> 00:23:29,290
can definitely be saved.

351
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,010
Highly unlikely.

352
00:23:32,550 --> 00:23:33,140
He's under Curse Sorcery.

353
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:36,140
Curse Sorcery?

354
00:23:38,790 --> 00:23:39,460
What did I say?

355
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:40,660
Curse Sorcery.

356
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:45,250
A thousand years ago,

357
00:23:45,270 --> 00:23:46,460
during the Deity-Demon War,

358
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:48,460
there was a demon clan

359
00:23:48,590 --> 00:23:51,460
that could control minds with curses.

360
00:23:52,070 --> 00:23:52,940
Later, that clan

361
00:23:53,350 --> 00:23:55,660
was wiped out by the Grand Mage.

362
00:23:55,790 --> 00:23:57,140
I guess some survived.

363
00:23:57,750 --> 00:23:58,900
They're after the Seizing Sect.

364
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:01,460
Can my Mentor still be saved?

365
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,010
It's a long shot.

366
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:05,530
But for unresolved matters,

367
00:24:05,550 --> 00:24:06,940
we must rely on our own efforts.

368
00:24:08,790 --> 00:24:09,940
Thanks, Stone Man.

369
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:11,700
Senior.

370
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:13,940
Mentor will surely be back.

371
00:24:16,830 --> 00:24:17,530
Ascendance Sect.

372
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:19,940
Let me out.

373
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:22,090
So noisy. Shut up.

374
00:24:22,550 --> 00:24:23,330
Who are there?

375
00:24:23,510 --> 00:24:25,140
You don't know who we are?

376
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:27,810
We are the Xiongs.

377
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:30,140
Born with divine strength and looks,

378
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,860
unmatched by anyone in the world.

379
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:32,860
In what way?

380
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:34,050
In being shameless?

381
00:24:35,790 --> 00:24:36,660
Hey, Ascendance Sect.

382
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,220
Can you keep me here?

383
00:24:38,790 --> 00:24:40,770
I come and go as I please.

384
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:43,290
I'm staying because I want to.

385
00:24:49,640 --> 00:24:50,980
What took you so long?

386
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:52,530
Your Highness, I'm here to save you.

387
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:54,050
Your Highness?

388
00:24:57,110 --> 00:24:57,900
Well...

389
00:24:58,960 --> 00:24:59,700
It's just...

390
00:24:59,720 --> 00:25:01,660
My family is a bit special.

391
00:25:06,750 --> 00:25:07,770
You know each other?

392
00:25:07,790 --> 00:25:09,530
Why did you pick on him yesterday?

393
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:12,530
Yesterday was a misunderstanding.

394
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:14,530
I didn't see he was holding back.

395
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,660
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

396
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:17,900
Come here.

397
00:25:18,510 --> 00:25:19,990
- She looks super rich.
- This battle is a human affair.

398
00:25:19,990 --> 00:25:21,020
- It has nothing to do with us.
- We need a plan

399
00:25:21,020 --> 00:25:21,620
to scam her.

400
00:25:22,160 --> 00:25:24,330
Pearl Elites will protect you.

401
00:25:24,590 --> 00:25:26,530
Good, let's get out of here first.

402
00:25:26,550 --> 00:25:26,980
Come on.

403
00:25:27,110 --> 00:25:27,490
Let's go.

404
00:25:29,550 --> 00:25:30,250
What are we waiting for?

405
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:31,180
Stone Man.

406
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:32,140
Actually,

407
00:25:33,590 --> 00:25:33,860
I...

408
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:36,090
I can't leave with you.

409
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:36,730
Why?

410
00:25:37,310 --> 00:25:37,860
Think about it.

411
00:25:38,350 --> 00:25:39,620
My Mentor, Senior,

412
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:40,530
and my Juniors

413
00:25:40,550 --> 00:25:41,050
are all here.

414
00:25:41,750 --> 00:25:42,770
How can I abandon them?

415
00:26:00,110 --> 00:26:00,900
An earthquake?

416
00:26:02,350 --> 00:26:02,940
Don't worry.

417
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:04,980
Not a quake. The Defending Formation

418
00:26:05,590 --> 00:26:06,530
is about to break.

419
00:26:07,350 --> 00:26:07,770
We're doomed.

420
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:11,050
Set up the formation.

421
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:20,900
After today,

422
00:26:21,640 --> 00:26:24,140
Ascendance Sect will be devastated.

423
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:28,290
Elder Kuai Si will save the day

424
00:26:28,310 --> 00:26:32,490
and rebuild with Westdawn's help.

425
00:26:33,550 --> 00:26:34,620
From then on,

426
00:26:35,110 --> 00:26:37,050
I'll shock the Primordial World

427
00:26:37,350 --> 00:26:39,980
and make history.

428
00:26:46,270 --> 00:26:47,460
The Ascendance Sect people

429
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:51,090
did gather on one peak.

430
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:55,380
Surround them and leave none alive.

431
00:26:55,750 --> 00:26:57,620
We will kill Changgeng

432
00:26:58,310 --> 00:26:59,860
and find the Pregenesis Sword.

433
00:27:16,750 --> 00:27:18,700
You dare block my way?

434
00:27:38,880 --> 00:27:39,860
A toad?

435
00:27:43,950 --> 00:27:45,960
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

436
00:27:46,110 --> 00:27:48,040
♪I dare to live my own way♪

437
00:27:48,040 --> 00:27:50,400
♪In the Primordial World♪

438
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:52,380
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

439
00:27:52,540 --> 00:27:54,750
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

440
00:27:54,750 --> 00:27:56,790
♪Roaming the city with reckless courage♪

441
00:27:57,350 --> 00:27:58,940
Senior, what were you doing?

442
00:27:59,140 --> 00:28:00,480
♪And in dreams, I reign supreme♪

443
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:01,700
Remember the Gnatsting Needle?

444
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:04,620
I read many books

445
00:28:05,070 --> 00:28:06,490
until I found it

446
00:28:06,590 --> 00:28:08,330
in one that recorded

447
00:28:08,350 --> 00:28:09,490
about ancient demons.

448
00:28:09,790 --> 00:28:11,140
It's called Gnatsting Needle.

449
00:28:12,030 --> 00:28:14,700
A weapon of the Blood Gnat Clan.

450
00:28:15,590 --> 00:28:17,770
The weapon Yuan Qing used to strike.

451
00:28:17,790 --> 00:28:18,490
Right.

452
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,250
Since then,

453
00:28:20,550 --> 00:28:22,330
I've been setting up defenses.

454
00:28:22,350 --> 00:28:23,290
Didn't you notice

455
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:25,290
the local plants and animals

456
00:28:25,310 --> 00:28:27,010
have been growing so fast?

457
00:28:27,250 --> 00:28:29,580
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

458
00:28:29,750 --> 00:28:31,050
Senior, you are amazing.

459
00:28:31,070 --> 00:28:32,250
You even kept a backup plan.

460
00:28:32,250 --> 00:28:33,050
♪Unruly♪

461
00:28:33,050 --> 00:28:35,880
♪A carefree smile♪

462
00:28:53,030 --> 00:28:54,180
My linked maze formation

463
00:28:54,480 --> 00:28:56,940
was upgraded and optimized

464
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:58,940
step by step

465
00:28:58,960 --> 00:29:00,250
during their trials.

466
00:29:00,510 --> 00:29:04,460
Now, it's a giant formation.

467
00:29:04,480 --> 00:29:06,860
Even Zhao Gongming can't escape it,

468
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:08,940
let alone those attackers.

469
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:10,730
They don't stand a chance.

470
00:29:11,350 --> 00:29:12,860
So you had it planned all along.

471
00:29:17,900 --> 00:29:20,020
[Lost?]

472
00:29:50,790 --> 00:29:52,940
What's wrong with this sect?

473
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:03,530
I have waited so long.

474
00:30:04,750 --> 00:30:06,220
Why aren't they here?

475
00:30:08,640 --> 00:30:09,530
Did they

476
00:30:10,550 --> 00:30:13,420
run into trouble on the way?

477
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:24,330
Finally.

478
00:30:26,110 --> 00:30:26,900
What is going on?

479
00:30:28,160 --> 00:30:29,010
Elder Kuai Si,

480
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:30,770
Changgeng blocked our army.

481
00:30:30,790 --> 00:30:31,570
Help us...

482
00:30:35,830 --> 00:30:36,620
Mentor.

483
00:30:36,960 --> 00:30:38,140
We waited for two hours,

484
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:40,050
and only a mosquito showed up.

485
00:30:43,880 --> 00:30:44,530
Good.

486
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:46,250
Well done.

487
00:30:47,440 --> 00:30:48,380
Keep patrolling.

488
00:30:49,070 --> 00:30:50,090
Yes, Mentor.

489
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:55,940
If there is a flaw in your plan,

490
00:30:56,440 --> 00:30:58,180
it must be your Mentor.

491
00:30:59,750 --> 00:31:00,940
Relax, Yunxiao.

492
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:02,250
I put Mentor

493
00:31:02,270 --> 00:31:04,570
in the absolute safest place

494
00:31:04,790 --> 00:31:06,730
in our entire sect,

495
00:31:07,400 --> 00:31:09,180
protected by a linked maze.

496
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:12,380
Aren't you afraid
he'll break the art himself?

497
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:16,730
His foundation was damaged early on.

498
00:31:16,790 --> 00:31:18,860
I treated him for thirty years.

499
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:20,980
If he forces through it,

500
00:31:21,240 --> 00:31:24,180
it will ruin his foundation again.

501
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:25,730
When the next tribulation comes,

502
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:27,330
he will surely die.

503
00:31:28,790 --> 00:31:31,140
Though Mentor isn't very bright,

504
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:32,700
he still values his life.

505
00:31:34,400 --> 00:31:35,730
The unexpected always happens.

506
00:31:36,750 --> 00:31:39,490
Aren't you worried you missed something?

507
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:42,570
After all, Fate is unpredictable.

508
00:31:43,830 --> 00:31:44,620
Junior?

509
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:48,940
Senior?

510
00:31:50,270 --> 00:31:51,290
Is that you, Senior?

511
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:53,570
Junior?

512
00:31:54,790 --> 00:31:56,090
Senior, is that you?

513
00:31:57,240 --> 00:31:58,420
Junior, where are you?

514
00:31:58,550 --> 00:31:59,860
I'm here.

515
00:32:00,750 --> 00:32:02,570
I'm here.

516
00:32:03,830 --> 00:32:04,660
Are you not here?

517
00:32:04,750 --> 00:32:05,460
Senior.

518
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:06,420
I'm here.

519
00:32:06,440 --> 00:32:07,700
Don't leave, Senior.

520
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,940
I've been waiting here, Senior.

521
00:32:10,160 --> 00:32:12,620
I thought someone would wait here.

522
00:32:13,030 --> 00:32:13,810
Senior.

523
00:32:14,440 --> 00:32:15,770
Senior, don't leave.

524
00:32:16,350 --> 00:32:17,380
Don't leave.

525
00:32:18,510 --> 00:32:20,290
I've been waiting here for you.

526
00:32:20,550 --> 00:32:21,220
So...

527
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:23,490
I was overthinking?

528
00:32:32,400 --> 00:32:34,380
I've been waiting here for you.

529
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:44,380
Mentor.

530
00:32:45,070 --> 00:32:45,530
Mentor.

531
00:32:46,310 --> 00:32:47,770
Mentor is trying to break it.

532
00:32:50,110 --> 00:32:51,140
Junior, cover for me again.

533
00:32:51,830 --> 00:32:52,250
Okay.

534
00:33:09,590 --> 00:33:10,380
Something's wrong?

535
00:33:12,960 --> 00:33:14,140
That old man hid something from me.

536
00:33:15,830 --> 00:33:16,730
So you miscalculated.

537
00:33:17,510 --> 00:33:18,700
My calculations were flawless.

538
00:33:19,030 --> 00:33:20,010
He's just too foolish.

539
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:21,980
He walked into such an obvious trap.

540
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,420
Did you ever consider

541
00:33:23,750 --> 00:33:25,620
that not everyone in this world

542
00:33:25,790 --> 00:33:26,860
calculates everything like you?

543
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:43,730
Senior.

544
00:33:44,790 --> 00:33:45,620
Senior, wait for me.

545
00:33:46,070 --> 00:33:47,220
I'm here, Senior.

546
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:06,140
Senior.

547
00:34:07,160 --> 00:34:07,810
Senior.

548
00:34:09,840 --> 00:34:10,530
Senior.

549
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:12,170
Senior, where are you?

550
00:34:12,550 --> 00:34:14,740
I've been waiting here, Senior.

551
00:34:15,230 --> 00:34:16,010
Junior.

552
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:18,130
Junior.

553
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:19,690
Senior.

554
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:21,130
Junior, I'm here.

555
00:34:22,920 --> 00:34:23,570
Senior?

556
00:34:29,550 --> 00:34:30,050
Senior?

557
00:34:40,150 --> 00:34:41,780
Tomorrow, you'll leave for the assembly.

558
00:34:42,030 --> 00:34:43,210
I'm worried your power is too weak

559
00:34:43,230 --> 00:34:44,460
to defeat the demons.

560
00:34:44,550 --> 00:34:45,980
So I made an amulet for you.

561
00:34:46,960 --> 00:34:48,260
Junior, I'm right here.

562
00:34:58,320 --> 00:34:58,820
Junior.

563
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:05,090
This jade talisman

564
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:07,860
was left by Senior.

565
00:35:14,670 --> 00:35:15,740
Kuai Si.

566
00:35:18,590 --> 00:35:19,530
My Senior

567
00:35:22,150 --> 00:35:24,780
gave this jade talisman to me.

568
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:44,940
It's a Voice-Transmitting Jade Talisman.

569
00:35:45,110 --> 00:35:47,740
Found where the Divine-Demon

570
00:35:47,760 --> 00:35:48,860
Tribulation occurred.

571
00:35:49,190 --> 00:35:50,380
Inside this talisman

572
00:35:50,480 --> 00:35:52,170
are the words Senior Wan Jiangyu

573
00:35:52,840 --> 00:35:53,980
left for you.

574
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:11,130
Kuai Si.

575
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:13,130
There is nothing.

576
00:36:13,630 --> 00:36:15,420
I cast a Silencing Spell.

577
00:36:15,880 --> 00:36:16,570
Kuai Si!

578
00:36:22,550 --> 00:36:23,340
Kuai Si.

579
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:28,570
Kuai Si. Junior.

580
00:36:30,070 --> 00:36:32,050
Please, I beg you.

581
00:36:32,110 --> 00:36:33,530
I beg you.

582
00:36:33,550 --> 00:36:34,380
I'll do whatever you want.

583
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,780
I'm even willing to die.

584
00:36:36,630 --> 00:36:38,570
Please undo the spell.

585
00:36:38,590 --> 00:36:40,260
I want to hear what Senior said.

586
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:42,210
I want to hear her voice.

587
00:36:43,590 --> 00:36:44,820
Do you want to know

588
00:36:45,230 --> 00:36:47,260
what she actually said to you?

589
00:36:47,280 --> 00:36:47,940
Yes.

590
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,900
Yes. Yes.

591
00:36:51,190 --> 00:36:53,490
Just let Li Changshou

592
00:36:53,880 --> 00:36:56,740
enter the Mini Realm Scroll,

593
00:36:58,670 --> 00:37:01,690
and I'll undo this Silencing Spell.

594
00:37:08,840 --> 00:37:09,300
Fine!

595
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:10,940
Fine.

596
00:37:11,320 --> 00:37:12,610
Fine. Kuai Si.

597
00:37:12,880 --> 00:37:13,740
Hurry and undo it.

598
00:37:14,030 --> 00:37:14,940
Please undo it now.

599
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:16,610
Please. I'm begging you.

600
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:18,420
Please. I'm begging you.

601
00:37:18,440 --> 00:37:19,980
Kuai Si.

602
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:20,980
Please undo it.

603
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:22,530
Kuai Si, I beg you.

604
00:37:39,960 --> 00:37:40,740
Senior.

605
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:45,380
Wanna know where she actually went?

606
00:37:45,510 --> 00:37:47,860
Let me tell you.

607
00:38:03,710 --> 00:38:04,780
Kuai Si.

608
00:38:07,030 --> 00:38:07,530
Senior.

609
00:38:12,510 --> 00:38:15,130
What did you do to this talisman?

610
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:19,300
This talisman

611
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:23,690
was indeed left by Wan Jiangyu.

612
00:38:29,710 --> 00:38:30,490
However,

613
00:38:31,510 --> 00:38:34,380
I didn't find it in the South Sea.

614
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:38,530
It was in Kuru Land.

615
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:42,210
When I killed her.

616
00:38:45,710 --> 00:38:46,690
Back then,

617
00:38:47,070 --> 00:38:48,740
you were a perfect couple.

618
00:38:49,110 --> 00:38:50,530
Envied by everyone.

619
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:53,130
But she was so beautiful,

620
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:55,170
you weren't the only one

621
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:57,530
who fell for her.

622
00:38:59,230 --> 00:38:59,780
Junior.

623
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:03,900
Why?

624
00:39:04,760 --> 00:39:07,490
Why did she love only you?

625
00:39:07,630 --> 00:39:09,690
Only you, Qi Yuan.

626
00:39:10,230 --> 00:39:12,690
Why wouldn't she even look at me?

627
00:39:19,840 --> 00:39:20,610
Senior.

628
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,170
What makes you so special?

629
00:39:27,510 --> 00:39:29,740
Why you? Why?

630
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:33,900
I thought if I ruined you,

631
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:36,090
she'd finally look at me.

632
00:39:36,400 --> 00:39:37,740
But I never expected

633
00:39:38,590 --> 00:39:40,090
she would leave Ascendance Sect

634
00:39:40,590 --> 00:39:43,090
just to save you.

635
00:39:45,230 --> 00:39:47,420
For a useless waste like you.

636
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:51,420
She went into danger in North Land.

637
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,380
Just for a waste like you!

638
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:57,980
I hated her for that.

639
00:39:59,070 --> 00:40:00,650
So I followed her

640
00:40:00,960 --> 00:40:02,860
all the way to North Land.

641
00:40:08,630 --> 00:40:10,650
I lured a fierce beast

642
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,690
to attack her.

643
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:33,900
Senior, are you okay?

644
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:36,980
Kuai Si, why are you here?

645
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:39,340
Don't try to talk. I'll get you out.

646
00:40:39,760 --> 00:40:40,210
Come on.

647
00:40:41,320 --> 00:40:42,420
I won't make it.

648
00:40:44,800 --> 00:40:46,050
There's something

649
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:47,980
I'd like to ask you.

650
00:40:49,800 --> 00:40:51,300
Please take this Jade Talisman

651
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:53,740
back to Ascendance Sect

652
00:40:54,360 --> 00:40:55,980
and give it to Qi Yuan.

653
00:40:57,230 --> 00:41:00,490
I have so much to tell him.

654
00:41:01,190 --> 00:41:04,530
It's all in the Jade Talisman.

655
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:13,090
It's for Qi Yuan?

656
00:41:14,030 --> 00:41:15,050
Please.

657
00:41:15,880 --> 00:41:17,380
Give it to Qi Yuan.

658
00:41:32,110 --> 00:41:32,740
Okay.

659
00:41:34,190 --> 00:41:34,940
Senior.

660
00:41:36,550 --> 00:41:37,530
I promise.

661
00:41:39,190 --> 00:41:41,690
I'll surely give it to Qi Yuan.

662
00:41:43,480 --> 00:41:44,980
All these years,

663
00:41:46,000 --> 00:41:49,170
you've been waiting for her like a fool.

664
00:41:49,550 --> 00:41:50,530
Actually,

665
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:54,980
she died at my hand long ago.

666
00:42:00,480 --> 00:42:01,940
Qi Yuan.

667
00:42:03,190 --> 00:42:07,650
Watching you suffer lovesickness daily,

668
00:42:08,150 --> 00:42:11,260
it just makes me happy.

669
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:24,090
Resentment

670
00:42:24,630 --> 00:42:28,530
is the finest weapon in this world.

671
00:43:02,760 --> 00:43:08,540
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

672
00:43:09,210 --> 00:43:15,910
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

673
00:43:17,440 --> 00:43:23,490
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

674
00:43:24,120 --> 00:43:30,570
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

675
00:43:31,310 --> 00:43:38,430
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

676
00:43:38,810 --> 00:43:45,710
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

677
00:43:46,090 --> 00:43:53,440
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

678
00:43:53,440 --> 00:44:00,610
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

679
00:44:16,750 --> 00:44:21,920
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

680
00:44:23,010 --> 00:44:30,030
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

681
00:44:31,220 --> 00:44:37,160
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

682
00:44:37,860 --> 00:44:44,940
♪Alas, our story is short♪

683
00:44:45,280 --> 00:44:52,390
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

684
00:44:52,710 --> 00:44:59,190
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

685
00:44:59,970 --> 00:45:07,180
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

686
00:45:07,570 --> 00:45:15,390
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
